{
  "_comment": "FACILITATOR-ONLY. Estate-agnostic metadata for Phase 6 agent provisioning (06_provision_agents). The committed pac workspace under 'workspace/' holds each agent's instructions, knowledge and tools; this manifest holds what the workspace YAML does NOT: owner, environment, the connections to bind, and the chat audience. The engine resolves canonical names to this estate's live ids at run time (see _estate.ps1). 'capture' = how the workspace is obtained: 'authored' (benign, committed here) or 'clone' (build once in the portal, then `pac copilot clone` into setup/agents/ and commit - used for the planted agents whose config is not authored here). coOwners = personas made co-owners of the agent (added to its <botid>_1 team), e.g. the service account whose connection the agent's tools run on. teamsChannel = add the Microsoft 365 and Teams channel (Lab 04 chats in Teams); done in the browser as the owner by lib/enable_teams_channel.py.",
  "environments": {
    "Halcourt-Prod": "estate-suffixed",
    "Claims-Test": "estate-suffixed",
    "Maker-Sandbox": "estate-suffixed",
    "Halcourt (default)": "shared"
  },
  "_connections_comment": "OAuth connections the engine creates and authenticates per owner (headless consent). connector = the shared_* connector id; params = extra connectionParameters (e.g. the Graph HTTP connector needs its resource URIs); shareWith = a group to share it with (note: OAuth connections often refuse sharing - ConnectionSharingNotAllowed - the engine warns and continues). connector = \"custom\" with customConnector {workspace, name} is a CUSTOM connector the engine creates from the workspace's apiDefinition/apiProperties (the Underwriting MCP server, as a real Copilot Studio MCP tool); apiKeyFrom names the azd value its connection's API key is built from - no consent. HTTP actions and Power Automate flows are NOT here: they are configured inside the agent workspace/flow, not as consented connections.",
  "connections": {
    "SP-HR-Benefits": {
      "connector": "shared_sharepointonline",
      "environment": "Halcourt-Prod",
      "owner": "marcus.webb"
    },
    "SP-HR-FAQ": {
      "connector": "shared_sharepointonline",
      "environment": "Halcourt-Prod",
      "owner": "marcus.webb"
    },
    "DV-Claims-Shared": {
      "connector": "shared_commondataserviceforapps",
      "environment": "Claims-Test",
      "owner": "svc-claims",
      "shareWith": "Claims-Adjusters"
    },
    "SP-Onboarding": {
      "connector": "shared_sharepointonline",
      "environment": "Halcourt (default)",
      "owner": "tom.dean"
    },
    "O365-Outlook-Onboarding": {
      "connector": "shared_office365",
      "environment": "Halcourt (default)",
      "owner": "tom.dean"
    },
    "Graph-DevKim": {
      "connector": "shared_webcontents",
      "environment": "Maker-Sandbox",
      "owner": "dev.kim",
      "params": {
        "Token:ResourceUri": "https://graph.microsoft.com",
        "BaseResourceUrl": "https://graph.microsoft.com"
      }
    },
    "DV-CRM-Shared": {
      "connector": "shared_commondataserviceforapps",
      "environment": "Halcourt-Prod",
      "owner": "tom.dean",
      "shareWith": "Halcourt-Makers"
    },
    "OneDrive-DevKim": {
      "connector": "shared_onedriveforbusiness",
      "environment": "Maker-Sandbox",
      "owner": "dev.kim"
    },
    "MCP-Underwriting": {
      "connector": "custom",
      "environment": "Halcourt-Prod",
      "owner": "priya.nair",
      "customConnector": {
        "workspace": "underwriting-assistant/mcp-connector",
        "name": "Halcourt-Underwriting-MCP"
      },
      "apiKeyFrom": "MCP_BEARER"
    }
  },
  "_flows_comment": "Copilot-triggered cloud flows the engine creates (as the owner) BEFORE agents, so ${FLOW:<name>} resolves. definition = a file under setup/data/.",
